        "original_id": "f42d8e27-68f6-5753-99a6-413d8c5f5ab9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Gugino\n- Organizations: Warner Bros.\n- Systems: DC Extended Universe\n- Topics: Films, media franchises\n\nFacts:\n- Carla Gugino was born on August 29, 1971, and she is an American actress.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film \"Son in Law\" in 1993.\n- The DC Extended Universe is an American media franchise and shared universe centered on a series of superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film \"Sin City\" in 2005.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film \"Night at the Museum\" in 2006.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film \"Mr. Popper's Penguins\" in 2011.\n- Carla Gugino appeared as Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film \"San Andreas\" in 2015.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature films \"The Space Between Us\" and \"Gerald's Game\" in 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
